    <title>EP71 树根与花粉的证言</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6b02fe4577e5b18a33311b45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6b02fe4577e5b18a33311b45</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:56:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"><blockquote><p><strong><em><span>我能通过逝者身上的一片落叶、一粒种子，看见TA走过的路，见过的人，未尽之事，未说之话。——帕特里夏·威尔特希尔</span></em></strong></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>🎉🎉🎉本期节目我们将在评论区抽取三位听友，送出《植物证言》这本书！欢迎大家踊跃评论～</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>您也可以直接</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/goods-detail/6aba0ebfc81a980015e3d243?t=1795396892019&amp;xsec_token=ABNOoolHlMfHrFp3JwdDSjkLX3ADcXF2Sx7ckC5ImkubI%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_arkselfshare" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/goods-detail/6aba0ebfc81a980015e3d243?t=1795396892019&amp;xsec_token=ABNOoolHlMfHrFp3JwdDSjkLX3ADcXF2Sx7ckC5ImkubI%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_arkselfshare"><strong><span>点击购买</span></strong></a><strong><span>～</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvMTsFFtSWHPIoz16ZcvI5OpFr6p.png"><p></p><p><span>死亡不是生命的终结，而是自然循环的开始。</span></p><p><span>构成我们的原子，都来自于自然，最后我们死了，再次尘归尘，土归土，周而复始。</span></p><p><span>自然孕育我们，自然也可以为逝者发声，向生者揭示真相。</span></p><p><span>没有完美的犯罪，只有未被察觉的自然遗迹。</span></p><p></p><h2><strong><span>--章节--</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> 一截树根</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="865">14:25</a> 消失九个月的女孩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1369">22:49</a> 头发里的花粉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a> 花园里的答案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2654">44:14</a> 庭审和后续</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3010">50:10</a> 植物证言</span></p><h2><strong><span>--图片--</span></strong></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkIjnyLWN3dh2HyoCRKmS46D-BaE.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FogeQXbCS7__PFHtg-DnLZidxhZn.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flepc8sA4h88SGcK203gYEghYhKO.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjHolN10106fsyn3Vtto3E3G8bQd.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsx0mpLnmA2BAVKQAexzlgfyuKLw.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhjBTEun6Ry0zcXXN1bWX79C2FW6.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnL6Hj418HykLlAl4aSrUWuQD_ub.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmcVQQEwnVcMyweJu-fmxEAfPA7b.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnLCbi_-c6LJ5GQijnxgmFoP5XbK.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmtPm11rLrvzFgOlMthqEphJLKCb.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSIad4wH9Dl52izDJ_r5T4OYGe5.jpg"><h2><strong><span>--核心参考--</span></strong></h2><p><span>【新华网】京城神探王满仓首次亮相 一条潮虫引破碎尸大案</span></p><p><span>【Daily Mail】Child-killer already behind bars for murdering schoolgirl, 16, will die in jail after he is sentenced for 20-year sex attack spree as police fear he may be a serial killer</span></p><p><span>【Forensic Science International】Hair as a source of forensic evidence in murder investigations</span></p><p><span>【The Guardian】Latest science trapped murderer</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
