    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aca4bcc195d838e2aefe3af</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:35:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"><p><strong><span>***本期节目没有任何血腥描述，全年龄段友好～</span></strong></p><p><span>苦了太久，今天来点不一样的！本期节目主打一个莫名其妙，全程（试图）用新疆土话播讲，如果有哪里没听明白、没听清的，欢迎在评论区或者群里提问😁</span></p><h2><strong><span>--莫名其妙的章节--</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 假高院判决书案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> “中央组织部副部长”诈骗案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 五个“能人”案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> 小李克鲁斯之疯狂的玉石案</span></p><h2><strong><span>--莫名其妙的图片--</span></strong></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrMxIhcj1KEjrJ6E9SYHAXIf9Z_U.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJBgRubqNbtoYkxarSBHeQVolPj.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsR3jRqywpoTDoo-D2KR0d5TWF-Q.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgLcZ2n9V-Gj5mj57K95IdeC3FoF.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmbtlWe_LYJQjGtHqh1yA4HfYrtb.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlH748vS-Bw4DhY9CQPD7gKEtM5j.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fverrxr9kvDgHxHbNAdEZuMvVftw.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm-mR0H_WorFVxk8gdA-HSF14fO_.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtwIBei4EibQkQomGQoRX_irrq5G.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrT4dgGtOaSvxkTynMmK9eBotdQa.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk4h3MFND7CfGlNqT0zgHKKipPRH.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmgsYVYmC8Uby_CntL3sSXVNUkuD.jpg"><h2><strong><span>--莫名其妙的参考--</span></strong></h2><ul><li><p><span>法治在线《判决书迷案》</span></p></li><li><p><span>乌鲁木齐晚报《无业男子冒充中央领导伙同原新疆人大代表诈骗》</span></p></li><li><p><span>法制日报《五人环环相扣 诈骗近五千万元均获重刑》</span></p></li><li><p><span>乌鲁木齐晚报《堪比电影！乌鲁木齐一“蜘蛛人”从27楼索降至23楼盗走亿元玉石》</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
