  <item>
    <title>EP67 优胜美地的阴影｜美国斯泰纳兄弟案（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6abbc8ece742e36efcbccab7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6abbc8ece742e36efcbccab7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 14:27:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"><blockquote><p><strong><span>我多希望能有一个理由，可是没有。这一切毫无意义。wish there was a reason. But there isn’t. It’s senseless.</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span>——凯里·斯泰纳</span></p><p><strong><em><span>***本期节目有部分侵害描述，请酌情收听，未成年人不建议收听本期节目。</span></em></strong></p><p><span>上一期节目中史蒂文一生已经足够唏嘘。</span></p><p><span>十年后，1999年，优胜美地国家公园及周边区域，接连发生谋杀案。</span></p><p><span>斯泰纳这个姓氏再次被关注到，让整个悲剧更显沉重。</span></p><p><span>--章节--</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 她们怎么没来？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 雪松旅馆509号房间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">18:22</a> 汽车与遗体</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 乔伊失踪了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a> 自由人的最后一餐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> 你觉得公平吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3528">58:48</a> 审判与后续</span></p><h2><strong><span>--图片--</span></strong></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_vmsCgrVKSA66gKt0f1_h5kp_6.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk6jj6FOfxPYcGVE-ATQfpsBF15r.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrvEXh_1eRSLauS3VfVV6z9JivBq.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJwo32rIrC20B50S6MBUpwKICV9.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoKPK3cb13ws0HBlDvu-yAmobV6p.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FonmIryYgdnDnQY8jAuUXUeXAKev.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGCMA6pPRodxCg6VnzIERsLVfIe.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpIYvISFEPstXFHg_WvMpFzwtYJA.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiEXZNnMoQpwIEh5t3FLZZy2v6Uj.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg1_4mIDl4-FfEOGKend1JQFrvwQ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuwDvOukw7GPQnvU5QDk3BHXfWse.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkWeQH-OHlrqZ9VWeskDoVSny4Qz.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flb6Rriz-VaVzSpsd9Omk2Ico9EI.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuKgNtfJAhDojPznm2GvDiDaNve6.jpg"><h2><strong><span>--核心参考资料--</span></strong></h2><ul><li><p><span>Hulu纪录片《Captive Audience: A Real American Horror Story》</span></p></li><li><p><span>Mike Echols《I Know My First Name Is Steven》</span></p></li><li><p><span>ABC调查节目20/20专题《Evil in Eden》</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
