  <item>
    <title>EP66 该死的“救命恩人”｜女性自救两案连讲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aa2aa209d32647781672994</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aa2aa209d32647781672994</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:06:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"><blockquote><p><strong><span>勇气，是生命为赐予我们平静而索取的代价。Courage is the price that Life exacts for granting peace.</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span>——阿梅莉亚·埃尔哈特（Amelia Earhart）</span></p><p><strong><em><span>***本期节目有血腥暴力描述，不建议未成年人收听。</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>***本次案件一当中除坏人之外均使用了化名</span></em></strong></p><p><span>不管是天灾人祸，在最无法想象的平静日常中降临，是其残忍之处。</span></p><p><span>一瞬之间已经深处地狱，几秒前的日常竟然成了遥不可及的天堂。</span></p><p><span>自己都无法预料到的勇气与智慧，大概也会在此刻爆发。</span></p><p><span>回头看，最绝望的时刻，有一个最值得感谢的自己。</span></p><p><strong><span>--章节--</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>案件一：卧室地狱</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">1:25</a> 两次尖叫</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">4:25</a> 一个半小时</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a> 那双眼睛在暗处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 跨国追逃</span></p><p><strong><span>案件二：救命恩人</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 同一个、同一个</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 公路追杀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2358">39:18</a> 是你救了我</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 救护车</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3082">51:22</a> 审判与后续</span></p><h2><strong><span>--图片--</span></strong></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlXmKK-idICxgGFdM1nrR4P7Ucu0.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqidxAVGcvimXCsEfcAsvlastMJ_.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrRjhh-fPZ0qWdar_VR0DACSspit.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxBGyTMhxjFMHpt4Evy4vm8BIgG.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu1OYEaIuNSFBfcriADsfQaIiH_o.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgagPBHVCrOCXgvum4odROsAt9rv.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqvHnx2M4RHOZ9Y1NJ-8rmFmu6c0.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnhT_Tgpb-fyahYXZgIGRzk-ROeZ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnl_2Tv-H7U7oVwAiqHPhUrTqUiR.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsVIZNW3IFoNy7PfFyDTB7kitfPE.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqwSKCJkht37inaMJRkw_R6sBlYG.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
