  <item>
    <title>EP65 女士，您这17分钟八成是接客了吧？｜美国迈阿密酒店谜案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a959663a0210c197dcb374d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a959663a0210c197dcb374d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 15:03:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"><blockquote><p><strong><span>这种推论，建立在一个前提上：把“女人”这个群体定义成“妓女”。按照这种逻辑，只要一个女人曾经发生过性行为，无论自愿还是被迫，她似乎就再也不可能遭到性侵犯。</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span>——Catharine A. MacKinnon</span></p><p><span>伊娜被发现在一片荒草地了，她遭遇过重创，已经奄奄一息。很明显，她虽然还活着，但把她留在这里的人进行了一场“抛尸”。</span></p><p><span>前一晚，她还住在16公里外的那间酒店，一间有完备安保系统、监控覆盖相当全面的酒店。</span></p><p><span>可是警方翻遍了监控，也搞不清楚伊娜是怎样离开酒店的。</span></p><p><span>而伊娜在最后一次被拍到上电梯和她最后一次刷开房门之间，有神秘的“17分钟”，警方不禁怀疑，这位乌克兰裔的女性，是否在这个时间里“接客”了。</span></p><h2><strong><span>--章节--</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 她还活着</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="396">06:36</a> 从酒店“蒸发”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1303">21:43</a> 交给“肯”吧！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2033">33:53</a> 大个子与行李箱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> 我要找到你</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3468">57:48</a> “你是对的。”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4192">1:09:52</a> 审判</span></p><h2><span>--图片--</span></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs6zaJ9a0iWRgpppcR9TAEJc3Moe.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrXzAdDkWLvszsNPBNNHhJR4SnwC.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu2k3pUSlcgKf0TVlJPMnHDd8MnE.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuZxyHkx-Ch-8eaFUJxmlXUmi0aa.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fut0FzkrV8Kn0UDCjqy4d-tjdMSs.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmFOAt0wL5DFaVBkvlY9Q8XTh3ka.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs7nCA9QsIEC6GJR0t-p2WN1V-Gw.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpyf3KkE_Gvp6pghW5UtSOMicf5i.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjNaZ2sXj3sERTRpKyIKyR9-lN54.jpg"><h2><span>--核心参考--</span></h2><ul><li><p><span>【20/20】The Woman in the Suitcase</span></p></li><li><p><span>【ABC】Serial rapist was on the loose for years before an abandoned suitcase put a stop to his crimes</span></p></li><li><p><span>【Vanity Fair】The Case of the Vanishing Blonde</span></p></li><li><p><span>【JUSTIA U.S. Law】Colorado v. Jones (Colo. 2013)</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66f553b32adfe48b83a9e899/lhPV0D2_ee5iScp9kM-TYtZq3lHr.m4a" length="122047008" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:24:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjy4CCtbxfarktrP15IvRurplpRV.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
