    <title>EP64 你还有完没完？！｜《非诚勿扰》女嘉宾王佳杀夫案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a887245ef65145dfcc3527b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a887245ef65145dfcc3527b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 15:50:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"><blockquote><p><strong><span>如果忮忌是墙角慢慢爬上来的霉斑，那不甘便是雨停后，鞋底怎么都甩不掉的那层泥。</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><strong><em><span>***本案不包含血腥暴力描述，全年龄段友好</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>***本期节目中部分名字为化名</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>***感谢听友@柚柚提供本期选题</span></em></strong></p><p><span>2013年，一则“《非诚勿扰》女嘉宾杀夫”的消息传开了。随着媒体的跟进，人们惊愕地发现消息居然不假。且该名女嘉宾在当年只上了四期节目，却颇有知名度，还被称为“史上最真诚女嘉宾”。谁曾想不到短短两年，再听到她的消息，却是如此惨剧。</span></p><h2><strong><span>--章节--</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 女嘉宾杀夫？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a> “史上最真诚女嘉宾”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 生命中的另一半</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a> 我劝你再上一次《非诚勿扰》！</span></p><h2><strong><span>--图片--</span></strong></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqGgZ4-cGTAFodkAy9ke51Wp2cXv.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnEyyQpL6nwSA_McFbg8-51Qx2Wo.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu1sH3wrwOCRB_b68NUyNrlXDUV4.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZ4riFA1MTcqWpw1VyVM6-DRd5V.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmwdAArN7Y8cSNkR6ImTS_lOWF7A.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUt1hxKKKQBGfmYQN4zfFM8v8rR.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkDTRUq_DTNxL3MaLFNzDAJr8cL9.jpg"><hr><h2><strong><span>--核心参考--</span></strong></h2><ul><li><p><span>【新华社】“非诚”女嘉宾杀夫 从女神到人妇心意难平</span></p></li><li><p><span>【武汉晚报】网曝“非诚”女嘉宾砍死熟睡中老公 尸体早已火化</span></p></li><li><p><span>【新晚报】《非诚勿扰》杀夫女嘉宾将做精神病司法鉴定</span></p></li><li><p><span>【华商报】非诚勿扰"最真诚女嘉宾"被曝杀夫 老公并非牵手人</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66f553b32adfe48b83a9e899/lleAz5a7u_V2zGeyAtjmfvqz6piA.m4a" length="52847584" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcHc9iFtmI14aA86OaImQBaB47x.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
