  <item>
    <title>EP63 抓住卡罗琳！｜苏格兰未婚妻搜证破案录</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7b3f0e17676351c5706795</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7b3f0e17676351c5706795</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 15:32:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"><blockquote><p><strong><span>当一个女人说出真相，她也为更多真相的出现创造了可能。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>When a woman tells the truth she is creating the possibility for more truth around her.</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span>——美国诗人、女性主义作家Adrienne Rich</span></p><p><strong><em><span>***本期节目不包含血腥描述等，但仍建议未成年人在家长陪同下收听。</span></em></strong></p><p><span>“最糟能糟到哪里去呢？”</span></p><p><span>我们很多人都用这句话安慰自己，大多数情况下它也确实有用，它让你获得一种瞬间的洒脱感和勇气。</span></p><p><span>但卡罗琳在2020年那个晚上赴约的时候，却没想到这句话也许被老天当成了一个愿望。</span></p><p><span>自那之后，她的生活先被送上梦幻巅峰，又重重摔下。</span></p><p><span>当生活真的予以重击时，你总会对一切分崩离析的速度感到惊讶。</span></p><h2><strong><span>--章节--</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 卡罗琳，尽情歌唱吧！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 我们之间没有秘密</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 失踪事件</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 踩扁蓝色易拉罐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a> “那一天，警方抛弃了我。”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3575">59:35</a> 抓住卡罗琳！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5020">1:23:40</a> 当你爱自己时，才能吸引健康的关系。</span></p><h2><strong><span>--图片--</span></strong></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvBzQMixzc8dc5ilVCsz7F3eiHxn.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2DpUtTXLO7-A9v2PQidU3tBwpd.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlCtpPyEDwFb0Nb2DjLVZAyQfuJ-.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpDfyceXGNkj-v0DhQT2ybanlM6R.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq7EOLCnys70AvYUdAydXBkMcnqm.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoWhDOwKgLcDBBBmDl-TXZNCA_TJ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnzM-UW0IDmysWaGMmzb4fvXYU-s.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpp0T1VADHW3urlrFrVsfo5H6FqI.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkUcjU-YtSTk-sY9eqXSFTCO_4yq.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-shzMNBNv2BPUNL61eON5H3jJ1.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo3qfMJE3vHdpCftCtzyE02R23mi.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjXaVU9A24SSGj9BhdmYBOJegclp.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiBca0I3Dj6C1CXv2FbwrI-o4KJb.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtKWNrG73JVYJX6UleUIAhfjchPI.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FljUg5OXrgbtG698vdfZfHaX0cK-.jpg"><h2><strong><span>--核心参考资料--</span></strong></h2><p><span>1、Netflix：Should I Marry a Murderer?</span></p><p><span>2、BBC：Murder Case: The Vanishing Cyclist</span></p><p><span>3、苏格兰皇家检察署COPFS：Twin brothers who attempted to conceal death of charity cyclist jailed for total of 17 years and three months</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
