  <item>
    <title>EP62 “我”杀了我｜福建奇怪现场两案连讲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6b60d2b581962ce2be190f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6b60d2b581962ce2be190f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 14:39:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"><blockquote><p><strong><span>一个新想法会突然出现，而且往往以直觉的方式到来。但直觉，不过是以往智力经验的结果。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>A new idea comes suddenly and in a rather intuitive way. But intuition is nothing but the outcome of earlier intellectual experience.</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><span>——阿尔伯特·爱因斯坦</span></p><p><strong><em><span>***含少量血腥现场描述，不建议未成年人收听。</span></em></strong></p><p><span>这期节目的两个案子有一个共性——现场很奇怪。</span></p><p><span>「奇怪」意味着现场未见得复杂，却有很多相互矛盾的点。</span></p><p><span>一个猜想出现了，却不得不被推翻。</span></p><p><span>另一个猜想出现了，又不得不推翻。</span></p><p><span>当正确答案浮现的时候，不管答案本身有多离奇，突然一切都说得通了。</span></p><p><span>都说机会留给有准备的人，那「啊哈时刻」就只会留给坚持下去的人。</span></p><h2><strong><span>--章节--</span></strong></h2><p><strong><em><span>案件一：自他杀</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 他杀？自杀？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> 疑神疑鬼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 同时满足</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> “我什么也没想。”</span></p><p><strong><em><span>案件二：“我”杀了我</span></em></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a> “我杀人了，快报警！”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2014">33:34</a> 热心市民？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2870">47:50</a> 消失的106万</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3552">59:12</a> 被选中的人</span></p><h2><strong><span>--图片--</span></strong></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlO2YOL9NR8hAhLeDhxBGLRZ9oB8.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtnEzL0QkcKylzE6tFTDowCYr3VX.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhIe78zkvBLcY2fvoKPTmBo-gCAy.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo4SVMtUwsinU5pCpB-1uoqi-SS6.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv_EnYvnBhP1oDmFfU1-bxhxvmeu.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsfDghqIulyGk42aDWPhxElZClbK.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi93UcBSsT5cwFUqo2WUtl-EwLQc.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq1sxryarHLT_JzblRmsDMJjRq67.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpdPJUt9RITmGf7HjVThD-e5Yh-S.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnmd75OwXNntp1jZep0iOPB77Ctb.jpg"><h2><span>--核心参考资料--</span></h2><ul><li><p><span>【央视】重案揭秘·异样现场</span></p></li><li><p><span>【裁判文书网】罪犯黄祖磊故意杀人罪减刑裁定书</span></p></li><li><p><span>【央视】见证·发现之旅 寻找杀机：槟郎东里杀人案</span></p></li><li><p><span>【光明网】厦门“3·5”智能犯罪案侦破纪实</span></p></li><li><p><span>【中国大案录2】丧钟为自己而鸣</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"></li></ul><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
