  <item>
    <title>EP61 血腥蜜月 | 格鲁吉亚「黄金青年」劫机案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a5e340f6356eb2d9be5a062</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a5e340f6356eb2d9be5a062</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 14:53:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"><blockquote><p><strong><span>树根都已经被砍了，他还在祈祷叶子不要掉下来。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>ხეს ძირში ჭრიდნენ და – ფოთოლი არ ჩამოვარდესო</span></strong></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>——格鲁吉亚谚语</span></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>***本期节目不包含血腥描述，但仍建议未成年人在家长陪同下收听。</span></em></strong></p><p><span>自由诚可贵。</span></p><p><span>为了自由，是否值得冒着牺牲生命的风险？</span></p><p><span>那如果为了自由，冒着牺牲别人生命的风险呢？甚至这自由，必然是浸润了别人的鲜血呢？</span></p><p><span>七个年轻人，踏上了6833号航班。为了自由，他们要进行一场激进的冒险。</span></p><p><span>这场冒险究竟是理想主义的交响乐，还是人性的丧钟，至今仍然众说纷纭。</span></p><h2><strong><span>--章节--</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 失控的飞机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 黄金青年的婚礼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 去土耳其</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 逃离苏维埃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2615">43:35</a> 审判</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2930">48:50</a> “飞机男孩”</span></p><p><strong><span>--图片--</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr9nwd_fgxZCGqjcwIoAojIHXPcN.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk9YApab3QjaD6sqCexzYfui3JTz.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fte6BXNIf6fZi1RkdUTrI-dmJZbN.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTNr2-e5hsxUg4dmrO5XSBmJgiT.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FneoXAV1vjQ7n41D_af64JkNeNJS.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrII3zy-5-FCBoysAtaLuVjpLlof.jpg"><p></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTmBctxBrVZhxfNOIPbR7rpAWzj.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjkp_ZRcETafPiHBAaGHfXMg_oMP.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frnd0VIFDFngXMLkrxnuPqI_OM_Y.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fouvg_4F5ssdfmaYVxN9-Lk74lI4.jpg"><p><strong><span>--核心参考--</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>第比利斯国立大学格鲁吉亚历史研究所论文《“飞机男孩”：苏联神话与现实》</span></p></li><li><p><span>格鲁吉亚自由欧洲电台的40周年专题《“我让乘客一个个去厕所……”——劫机未遂40周年》</span></p></li><li><p><span>第比利斯博物馆联盟《我们并非只活一生》</span></p></li></ul><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66f553b32adfe48b83a9e899/lqE_79fahQc7uA9u25Fqv-kGy8ft.m4a" length="80680440" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:35</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgr5OQrF7lvrdN2rOZ7tfk06cQtD.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP60 “石河子的天终于蓝了。”｜新疆白波案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a525f324adef2b365626a8f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a525f324adef2b365626a8f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jul 2026 15:27:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"></figure><blockquote><p><span>做了人类想成仙；生在地上要上天。</span></p></blockquote><p><span>——鲁迅</span></p><p><strong><em><span>***本案不包含血腥暴力等描述，但仍建议未成年人在家长陪同下收听。</span></em></strong></p><p><span>新闻中扫黑除恶专项行动中的一个名字，背后是多少丑恶往事？</span></p><p><span>“有事找白哥。”是关系网中的本能反应，但是对于石河子的老百姓来说，这是“只手遮天”的暗无天日。</span></p><p><span>对于直接受害于那个黑社会组织的家庭来说，失去亲人的悲伤、凶手在逃的愤怒与害怕被针对被报复的恐惧更是延续了多年。</span></p><p><span>白波被抓之后，有人说：“石河子的天终于蓝了。”</span></p><p></p><h2><span>--章节--</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="50">00:50</a> 10万订阅中奖名单🎉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 三起怪案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 一封举报信</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">20:01</a> 编织大网的那根绳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">29:05</a> 进入石河子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 伞黑一体</span></p><h2><span>--图片--</span></h2><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fga1Zqyz2kb-iRwnqoGw54ZpUUtx.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnpdX73do_Tm876qOjZT6_yDl90d.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuu22D8IpFhbKs-2VS_-6tXzbSmU.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuCsjzdkJUg9xfPboZZCB0nvhwaQ.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtVxX_ZqknFJlGGQpDpbJX_CyBZa.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FriHYQk6XdmDcpj7CczetMHp594X.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjVACJljm-LIiPgvKWtJKuKj920q.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqODt3Kju77OzJPYV4PrNvJjevAI.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrcL-SNLH2t9HVW-b7LmRV1kLfVt.jpg"></figure><h2><span>--核心参考--</span></h2><ul><li><p><span>今日说法：剑指“黑与白”</span></p></li><li><p><span>北京青年报：一封举报信如何扫落公安局副局长</span></p></li><li><p><span>上观新闻：公安局长是黑老大，审讯时200多天不开口，突然有天唱起《从头再来》</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"></figure></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66f553b32adfe48b83a9e899/lopuIwBaT-nqak0ArBHKRUG6RFKc.m4a" length="92187380" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu1kGP8FLePOb80RCZ8p3OiRSDeV.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
