    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a4d2ac23fb7233cbf455bd7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 16:52:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmjxhCuavqXw67XKi2z8e5wB59gk.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 线索征集</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">03:57</a> 高雄碎尸案凶手张介宗死刑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 东莞交通肇事恶性案件19年告破</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 香港“霞姐”遇害案又一凶手落网</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 张鑫杀妻案一审</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">15:38</a> 新西兰华人邪教沉尸案裁决</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 德国男留学生系列强奸/谋杀未遂案</span></p><h2><span>--线索征集--</span></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtbOEhi2lq_eg6cI-NR8Q9fiwuZc.jpg"><h2><span>--图片--</span></h2><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fir1rZKnOjIfQXwSoVSlPAwdS1s0.jpg"><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b32bb297178f08ee73d56d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b32bb297178f08ee73d56d"><strong><em><span>⬆️这个案子我们讲过，电梯在此</span></em></strong></a><strong><em><span>《EP37 有进无出》</span></em></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtpopU3zfHZpkiLRADg4W03mbXFP.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmbdsp1ZEzNbltjo4yAV6LArjNnG.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmCeSTFIg5xYrXfgNJJqQs9zcD9o.jpg"><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/pgqaj3e2_4AifANaxMB4dQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/pgqaj3e2_4AifANaxMB4dQ"><strong><em><span>⬆️新京报：《一桩事先张扬的谋杀案》</span></em></strong></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr6GiM4yizN7cCz5PK37VmD5RpTA.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsnPA02rNZnzFW_t7V8-1yzwhQIQ.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fph98c-lRDFly9fOg08_i6DM9JVk.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuOGV0PG3C3CYwMIkF5n5PTneHf-.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVYuvH9_yyifQ0JnFkychSS-P31.jpg"><p><strong><span>⬆️ 推荐阅读——</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sPlv8FXLws1gc092xKgcFg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sPlv8FXLws1gc092xKgcFg"><strong><em><span>南方周末：《华人留学生迷奸案：加密群“暗语”，撕开精英面具下的恶》</span></em></strong></a></p><p><a href="https://www.lifeweek.com.cn/h5/article/detail.do?artId=240860" data-url="https://www.lifeweek.com.cn/h5/article/detail.do?artId=240860"><strong><em><span>三联生活周刊：《危险的“房客”：一场针对中国留学生的连环犯罪》</span></em></strong></a></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgw_OQQcIR-5pbNVLHLzehk9Yv5E.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWqqVR-Ek6gpnm-9YSz1o48MBFG.JPG"><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
